{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Sync Push Weekly",
  "description": "Manually starts the validated legacy Push weekly summary workflow.",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "userTriggered"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Run only the legacy DataWind Push weekly-summary workflow; never touch the KYC tabs, scripts, or hooks. Determine the latest fully closed Wednesday-to-Tuesday seven-day period and reject a period containing today. In the FortiVPN phase, verify DataWind access and start the old dashboard 41204 CDP Chrome. Once the user has logged in, prefer scripts/fetch-push-weekly.py to replay the query inside that browser session; it enforces absolute p_date, push_type=apppush, and UJ生命周期=未注册 without UI filtering. Only if replay is unavailable, start the 120-second listener before the user changes any DataWind filter; save uniquely prefixed local artifacts. Validate the capture with scripts/check-capture.py and scripts/validate-push-weekly.py, rejecting truncated or unmatched data. In the Clash phase, read the current target sheet before any write, run scripts/write-push-weekly.py dry-run, then request confirmation before --apply and finally read back all written rows. Target the legacy Push tab only; respect merged task-name cells by writing subsequent-period rows through B and D:H, not C."
  }
}